<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">2</book>
  <para style="h">Tesaloniki Filana Suran</para>
  <para style="toc3">2TH</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tesaloniki Filana</para>
  <para style="toc2">2TE</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kitabu Filana Tesalonikikailu Ma</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔli Alla la Kuma Kitabu Filana Tesalonikikailu Ma</para>
  <para style="ip">Sɛbɛ filana kɔndɔ mɛn sɛbɛra Tesalonikikailu ma, Talibidenba Pɔli ka kɔsɛ koilu ma a tɛrɛ ra mɛn fɔ a kitabu fɔlɔ kɔndɔ: Ɲininkali kɛ mɛn bɛnnin Isa la ko ma. Wo ko ye Tesaloniki lemɛniya mɔɔilu lamaala. Mɔɔ doilu ye a fɔla ii tɛma a la lon da se (suran 2 kuma diya 2), do banna baarala wo waati laban na ko rɔ, a ye lakaliya, ii la donin tora siila doilu kun ma (Suran 3 kuma diya 6 haan 12). Wo rɔ, Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin sɛbɛni kosa a ye hankili juu bɔ mɔɔilu kun dɔ mɛn ye Tesaloniki lemɛniya mɔɔilu tɔrɔla.</para>
  <para style="ip">Talibidenba Pɔli kuma damirala Alla tandoli yɛ le ma lemɛniya ni kaninteya la ko rɔ, Tesaloniki lemɛniya mɔɔilu ka mɛn yiraka, a ye Alla matarala kosa a ri ii fanka don baara rɔ ii kilini mɛn ma (suran 1 kuma diya 1 haan 12). Wo taminni, a nara Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin ka a fɔ kolo ma, mɛn bɛnnin Alla la Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko ma gbiliya rɔ. Wo ti kɛla fɔɔ mɔɔ madokonni do ye bɔ kɛnɛma, «Mɔɔ juu,» mɛn da wuli Alla kanma ka murunti Alla la Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin kanma (suran 2 kuma diya 1 haan 12). Juuya ba sɛɛbɛ la ko rɔ, ka bɛn lemɛniya mɔɔilu ye ii fanka donna ii lemɛniya rɔ Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma rɔ, ii tora Alla matarala waati bɛɛ la (suran 2 kuma diya 13 haan suran 3 kuma diya 5). Talibidenba Pɔli mɔnɛnin de kumala salatenilu ma, a ka a yiraka ii ye doilu baarala ɲa mɛn ma kosa ii la donin kana to mɔɔ si kun na (suran 3 kuma diya 6 haan 15). A ka a kuma laban duwawu ni foli le ma (suran 3 kuma diya 16 haan 18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu yɔrɔ do ka a fɔ, «Ni mɛn tɛ a fɛ baarala ko, hali wo tii fanan kana dɔɔnnin fen dɔɔn» (suran 3 kuma diya 10). Wo ye kumala Kitabu karanilu le yɛ ko ii ye a kɛ ii hankili ma ko a lemɛniya tɛ kɛ salaya ri, fɔɔ baara ye kɛ ko Alla ye ii lɔni mɛnilu ri lon lon.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Pɔli ni Silasi ni Timote le ka ɲin sɛbɛ ka a lawa an Fa Alla ni Ɲenematɔmɔnin Maari Isa la lemɛniya jama ma Tesaloniki so kɔndɔ. <verse eid="2TH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />An fa Alla ni Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye hina ni jususuma di ai ma.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiti la ko Maari na waati rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />N badenmailu, A bɛnnin de an ye baraka bila Alla yɛ ai la ko rɔ waati bɛɛ. Wo le dahani ka a masɔrɔn ai bɛɛ la lemɛniya ye warala kosɛbɛ, a ni ai la kaninteya fanan ai ɲɔɔn yɛ. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Wo le rɔ, an jɛrɛ ye ai matɔɔla Alla la lemɛniya jamailu tɛma ai la tunadiya ni ai la lemɛniya la ko rɔ hali ai tɔrɔni bɛnsɛnkɔlɔnteya rɔ.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Wo koilu ye a yirakala le ko Alla la kiti la ɲa telenni mɛn ye a kɛla ai ye jate mɔɔilu ri mɛnilu ye donna Alla la mansaya rɔ, ai ye ɲakankatan dɔ mɛn na ko rɔ. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Baa telenni Alla yɛ ka tɔrɔya lase woilu ma mɛnilu ye ai tɔrɔla, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />aile mɛnilu ɲakankatannin, ka ɲɔɲɔli di ai ma a ni an fanan. Wo ye kɛla le Maari Isa wa a yiraka waati mɛn na, ka bɔ sankolo rɔ a ni a la mɛlɛka fankamailu <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />ta mɛlɛn ba rɔ, ka Alla lɔnbaliilu ɲakankatan mɛnilu tɛ Maari Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma kuma mirala. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Woilu ri ɲakankatan habadan halaki le la, ii ri mase Maari ɲakɔrɔ a ni a la fanka masilanni. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Wo ye kɛla le a wa na lon mɛn na ii tɛma, a la jama sɛniman bɛɛ ri a gbiliya, ii ri kaba a ma mɛnilu bɛɛ lemɛniyani. Ai fanan di tɛrɛn woilu tɛma ka a masɔrɔn an ka sereya mɛn bɔ ai yɛ, ai lara le wo la.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Wo rɔ, an ye Alla matarala ai yɛ waati bɛɛ, kosa, a ra ai kili ko mɛn ma, ai ye dafa, ka bɛn wo ma. An ye a matarala fanan kosa, ai ra koɲuma mɛn bɛɛ ɲɛnikɛ, a ni ai wa baara mɛn kɛ ai la lemɛniya rɔ, Alla ye wo bɛɛ lakanbali a fanka fɛ. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />An ye wo matarali kɛla kosa an Maari Isa tɔɔ ye gbiliya ai rɔ, ai fanan ye gbiliya sɔrɔn ale rɔ, an na Alla ni Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na hina baraka rɔ.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Ko juu kɛla la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />N badenmailu, an ye na Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko le ma sisɛn a ni an nadɛn ko a tɔrɔfɛ. An ye ai madiyala, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />ni ai ka nabiya kuma doilu la ko mɛn wala kibaro wala bataki mɛn ye a fɔla ko Maari na lon da se, ai hankili kana kaliya tiɲanna, ka ai jusu bɔ, hali ii ka a fɔ ko a farani andeilu le la. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Ai kana sɔn mɔɔ si ye ai majuuwaya ɲa ɲa ma, baa wo lon ti nala sela fɔɔ wo murunti waati wa se fɔlɔ, sariya tɛ cɛɛ mɛn kan wo ri lankɛnɛmaya, halaki kɛ la den. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Mɔɔilu ye fen mɛnilu bɛɛ jatela «maari» ri, wala batofen di, a ye a jɛrɛ kɔrɔtala le woilu kunna, ka a wuli woilu kanma. Wo rɔ, a ri sii Alla batobonba kɔndɔ, ka a jɛrɛ yiraka Alla jɛrɛ ri.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.4</char> A ragbɛ Daniyɛli suran 11 kuma diya 36 ni Esekiyɛli suran 28 kuma diya 2 kɔndɔ.</note><verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />N tɛrɛ ai tɔrɔfɛ waati mɛn na, n tɛrɛ mɛn fɔla ai yɛ, ai ma ai janto woilu ma wa? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Adon, sisɛn ai ka a lɔn kosɛbɛ, mɛn ka wo cɛɛ makankan, kosa a ri lankɛnɛmaya a la waati wa se. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Ka a masɔrɔn sisɛn, sariyatanya ra baara damira gbundu rɔ. Kɔni a ye tola wo ɲa le ma haan mɛn ka a makankan, wo ye bɔ ye fɔlɔ. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Wo kɔrɔ, sariya tɛ cɛɛ mɛn kan wo ri lankɛnɛmaya, Maari Isa ye mɛn halakila a da fɔɲɔ la, ka a ban fewu a na ko nɔɔrɔ la. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Sariya tɛ cɛɛ mɛn kan wo ye nala Setana fanka baraka le rɔ, wuya kabannakoilu ni wuya tɔɔmasereilu ni wuya ko masilannin su bɛɛ fɛ, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />a ni telenbaliya su bɛɛ fɛ mɛnilu ye mɔɔ halakitailu majuuwayala, ka a masɔrɔn ii ma sɔn tuɲa kaninteya ma, kosa ii ye kisi. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Wo le rɔ, Alla ri fili fanka lana, kosa ii ri la wuya la. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Wo bɛɛ ye kɛla le kosa mɛnilu lemɛniyani tɛ tuɲa ma, telenbaliya duman mɛnilu yɛ, woilu ye makiti ii sɔn na.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ai suwandinin ai kisi ko le ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Kɔni n badenmailu, Maari kaninteilu, fɔɔ an ye baraka bila Alla yɛ ai la ko rɔ waati bɛɛ, ka a masɔrɔn kɛbi a damira Alla ka ai suwandi kisi ko le rɔ a la Nii Sɛniman na sɛninyala baraka rɔ a ni lemɛniya tuɲa rɔ. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />A ka ai kili wo le ma fanan Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma baraka rɔ, an ka mɛn fɔ ai yɛ, kosa ai ye gbiliya sɔrɔn mɛn bɔni an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Wo rɔ, n badenmailu, an ka ai karan namun mɛnilu la, a wa kɛ kawandi kan di wala bataki, ai ye woilu mira, ka to ii kan gben!<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Awa, an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin jɛrɛ ni an Fa Alla mɛn ka an kanin, ka habadan jususuma ni jii ɲuma di an ma a la hina rɔ, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />woilu ye ai lalemɛniya ai jusu rɔ, ka ai fanka don baara ɲuma ni kuma ɲuma bɛɛ rɔ.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Ai ye Alla matara an yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Tɔ la, an badenmailu, ai ye Alla matara an yɛ kosa Maari la kuma ye jɛnsɛn, ka gbiliya ikomin a ye ai wara ɲa mɛn ma, <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />kosa an ye kunka mɔɔ kɔrɔnilu ni mɔɔ juuilu ma, baa ii bɛɛ lemɛniyanin tɛ.<verse eid="2TH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Kɔni Maari telenni, a ri ai fanka don, ka ai latanka Ko Juu Tii ma. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />An lani ai la Maari la ko rɔ, ko an ka ai jamari mɛn na, ai ye wo kɛla ten, ai ri to a kɛla fanan. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Maari ye ai jusu lɔ Alla la kaninteya ni a la Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin na tunadiya la.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baara tɔnɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />N badenmailu, an ye ai jamarila an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin tɔɔ rɔ, ai ye ai mataa ai badenmailu bɛɛ la mɛnilu ra ii jɛrɛ to salaya rɔ, ii tɛ taamanna karan namunilu kan ai ka mɛnilu sɔrɔn an na. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Ai jɛrɛ ka a lɔn a bɛnnin ai ye an naden ɲa mɛn ma, ka a masɔrɔn an tɛrɛ tɛ salaya rɔ ai wara. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />An ma mɔɔ si la dɔɔnnifen dɔɔn an ma a sɔnkɔ di, kɔni an sɔnda le tɔrɔya ni kori ma, ka baara su ni tele rɔ, kosa an donin kana to mɔɔ si kun ma. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Wo tɛ wo ri ko an ti se wo sɔrɔnna ai bolo, kɔni kosa ai ye misali ta an ma. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Baa, an tɛrɛ ai tɔrɔfɛ waati mɛn na, an ka ai jamari le ko mɔɔ si ti sɔn baarala, wo kana dɔɔnnin kɛ.<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Adon, an da a mɛn ko mɔɔ doilu ye ai tɛma, salatenilu le woilu ri, ii tɛ baarala fɔɔ ka to ko rabasan na. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />An da wo mɔɔilu jamari, ka ii lalemɛniya Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin tɔɔ rɔ, ko ii ye baara jususuma rɔ kosa ii ye ii balo sɔrɔn ii la baara rɔ.<verse eid="2TH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Kɔni aile, badenmailu, ai kana kaɲa koɲuma kɛla. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Ni mɔɔ do ma sɔn kuma ɲinilu mirala an ka mɛnilu sɛbɛ bataki rɔ, ai ye wo tii lakɔrɔsi, foyi kana to ai le ni wo tii tɛma, kosa a ye maloya. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Kɔni ai kana a jate ai juu ri, kɔni ai ye a lalɔn ikomin ai badenma.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tuwali kanilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Maari Alla, jususuma tii ye jususuma di ai ma waati bɛɛ ni ɲa bɛɛ ma. Maari ye to ai bɛɛ fɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Nde Pɔli jɛrɛ le ka tuwali kan ɲinilu sɛbɛ. N na tɔɔmasere le ɲin di n na batakiilu bɛɛ kɔndɔ, n bolo nɔ le ɲin di.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />An Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na hina ye to ai bɛɛ fɛ.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>